      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1795537617454,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "两边均仅 1 次 Emb + 1 次问答 LLM，耗时几乎一致（~2.5s/题）\n；图谱的 BM25/BFS/RRF 为本地毫秒计算，几乎零增量成本。",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "两边均仅 1 次 Emb + 1 次问答 LLM，耗时几乎一致（~2.5s/题）\n；图谱的 BM25/BFS/RRF 为本地毫秒计算，几乎零增量成本。",
      "lineHeight": 1.65,
      "autoResize": true
    },
